# Weftwalking: "The first spell each player casts during each of their turns may be cast without paying its mana cost." Bot1 puts it onto the battlefield with Show and Tell. On T2 Bot2 casts Dauntless Scrapbot ({3}) for nothing with one Island, but cannot cast a second for want of mana. On T3 Bot1 casts one for nothing, and the second one it cannot pay for. Bot2's Lightning Bolt in Bot1's turn is not free: it is not Bot2's turn, and Bot2 has no mana (CR 118.9, 601.2b).

